  "body": "### Description\r\n\r\nWhen creating new users register_new_matrix_user command, every user is an Administrator.\r\n\r\n### Steps to reproduce\r\n\r\n> register_new_matrix_user  -c homeserver.yaml https://matrix.domain.com\r\n> New user localpart [root]: **user2**\r\n> Password:\r\n> Confirm password:\r\n> Make admin [no]: **no**\r\n> Sending registration request...\r\n> Success.\r\n\r\nThen send a chat a message to the user. In the Chat-Room preferences there is a list of all privileged users:\r\nuser1:matrix.domain.com is an Administrator\r\n**user2**:matrix.domain.com is an **Administrator**\r\n\r\n### Version information\r\n\r\nCurrent and older Synapse versions. Doesn't matter if Synapse is installed with PIP or from a Repository.\r\n",
